----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

let a = 1000

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

let c = a /! 10

----------
scriptunit-fragment
----------

let a_moved = a

----------
expect all three units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `a` moved |
| 2 | reads `a` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 100 |
| 3 | takes `a` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `a_moved` = 1000 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 2
----------

let c = a /! 100

----------
expect unit 2 is edited
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 2 reads `a`, which unit 3 took after it | `a` moved |
| 2 | reads `a` (1) | recompiles, runs | edited | `c` = 10 |
| 3 | takes `a` (1) | reruns | rerun: takes `a` from unit 1, which reran | `a_moved` = 1000 |
